BT 1 0 0 1 0 19.6 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 14.6 TL (Earlier versions of this guide, and the code comments, described these endpoints as nonce-protected. That was) Tj T* (wrong, and 0.8.2 corrected the description rather than the behaviour \227 because the behaviour is deliberate.) Tj T* ET
