BT 1 0 0 1 0 19.6 Tm 14.6 TL /F1 9.6 Tf .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (Up to 0.8.6 the widget sent an ) Tj /F4 9.6 Tf (X-WP-Nonce) Tj /F1 9.6 Tf ( header, which WordPress used to establish the current user for a) Tj T* (logged-in visitor. It was never treated as an authentication boundary, for two reasons:) Tj T* ET
Q
