q
1 0 0 1 62.3622 630.989 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 1 34.2 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (\177) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 34.2 Tm 14.6 TL /F2 9.6 Tf .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (There is nothing to authenticate.) Tj /F1 9.6 Tf ( A site-search assistant has to answer visitors who are not logged in, so) Tj T* (both endpoints are open by design. A nonce check would exclude nobody an attacker could not satisfy by) Tj T* (loading a page first.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.3622 581.189 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 1 34.2 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (\177) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 11 34.2 Tm 14.6 TL /F2 9.6 Tf .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (Enforcing it would break the widget on cached sites.) Tj /F1 9.6 Tf ( The nonce is printed into the page by) Tj T* /F4 9.6 Tf (wp_localize_script\(\)) Tj /F1 9.6 Tf (, so a page cache serves one visitor's nonce to everybody. A stale or foreign) Tj T* (nonce would fail verification on requests that have no business failing.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
