q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 48.8 Tm 14.6 TL /F1 9.6 Tf .184314 .184314 .247059 rg (From 0.8.7 the widget does not send the header at all. Sending it was actively harmful: WordPress verifies any) Tj T* (nonce a request supplies regardless of login state and rejects the request with 403 if it fails, so on a) Tj T* (page-cached site the stale nonce baked into the cached HTML broke the widget for every logged-out visitor) Tj T* (\(\247) Tj ( ) Tj (2.20\). Since neither endpoint performs a capability check, nothing was lost by dropping it.) Tj T* ET
Q
